---

<section class="contact container pixel-corners" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
	<h2 id="contact-heading">Contacto</h2>
	<p>
		¿Colaboramos? Escribime para proyectos, consultorías o charlas técnicas. Respondo en breve.
	</p>
	<ul class="channels">
		<li>
			<span class="label">Email</span>
			<a href="mailto:hola@ejemplo.com">hola@ejemplo.com</a>
		</li>
		<li>
			<span class="label">GitHub</span>
			<a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/sebasinmas</a>
		</li>
		<li>
			<span class="label">LinkedIn</span>
			<a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Perfil profesional</a>
		</li>
	</ul>
</section>

<style>
	.contact {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-outline-variant) 45%, transparent);
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-surface) 55%, transparent);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--color-on-surface);
	}

	p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		max-width: 42rem;
		color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.channels {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.channels li {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.15rem;
	}

	.label {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: var(--color-outline);
	}

	.channels a {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		color: var(--color-secondary);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	.channels a:hover {
		color: var(--color-primary);
	}
</style>
